   The software (source code, templates, stylesheets, scripts, translations
   and documentation) is protected by copyright. All rights remain with
   NEO Digital. This license does not sell any rights in the software; it
   grants a right of use.

2. Right of use
   Use on a publicly accessible website requires a valid license from
   NEO Digital. Its scope (number of websites, term, updates, support) is
   defined by the offer or license agreement. Without a license, the software
   may only be used for testing on non-public development and staging
   installations.

3. You may
   a) install and configure the software within the licensed scope;
   b) adapt configuration, templates, stylesheets and texts and modify the
      code for your own licensed installations;
   c) as an agency, install it for your clients within the licensed scope.

4. You may not
   a) distribute, publish, rent or sell the software or modified versions;
   b) grant sublicenses;
   c) offer the software or substantial parts of it as your own product or as
      a service to third parties;
   d) remove or alter copyright and license notices.

5. Third-party components
   Third-party components that are shipped or required (e.g. Contao, Symfony, Dompdf, the Arimo font (SIL Open Font License 1.1))
   are subject to their own licenses.

